#: ../../source/library-usage.rst:4 7baacb62dfea421cb6c8040dbc079b11
msgid "Python library API"
msgstr "Python 库 API"

#: ../../source/library-usage.rst:6 675c8e6c784c4861a1ede1e529b08e79
msgid ""
"``socid_extractor`` is a plain Python library: you hand it the text of a "
"profile page or API response and it hands back a flat dictionary of "
":doc:`ontology` fields. Nothing in the parsing path touches the network, so "
"you stay in full control of how pages are fetched."
msgstr ""
"``socid_extractor`` 是一个纯粹的 Python 库：你把个人资料页或 API 响应的文本交给它，它便返回一个由 "
":doc:`ontology` 字段组成的扁平字典。解析过程完全不涉及网络，因此你可以完全掌控页面的抓取方式。"

#: ../../source/library-usage.rst:12 a9fa5c308bb943b0af3f527278b178ca
msgid "Install and import"
msgstr "安装与导入"

#: ../../source/library-usage.rst:22 5c274cc54b6b4267b7d9e706551b0f63
msgid ""
"The package exports four public names: :func:`extract`, :func:`parse`, "
":func:`parse_cookies`, and :func:`mutate_url`."
msgstr ""
"该软件包导出四个公共名称：:func:`extract`、:func:`parse`、:func:`parse_cookies` 和 "
":func:`mutate_url`。"

#: ../../source/library-usage.rst:27 e53b6ab87e2043dc8f491c8aa0d0e7a8
msgid "extract"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/library-usage.rst:33 b7a3f669da3d467a88aec99ed460ae15
msgid ""
"``extract`` is a **pure function over a response body string** — it never "
"fetches anything. You pass in already-downloaded page text (HTML or an API "
"response), and it tries each built-in scheme in turn until one matches."
msgstr ""
"``extract`` 是一个\\ **作用于响应体字符串的纯函数**——它从不抓取任何内容。你传入已经下载好的页面文本（HTML 或 API "
"响应），它会依次尝试每个内置提取方案，直到有一个匹配为止。"

#: ../../source/library-usage.rst:37 acab7d1ff50a4ed0aef137dba34ead61
msgid ""
"On a match it returns a **flat dict of** :doc:`ontology` **fields** (for "
"example ``username``, ``fullname``, ``created_at``, ``is_verified``), plus "
"an ``_extractor`` key naming the scheme that matched."
msgstr ""
"匹配成功时，它返回一个\\ **扁平字典**\\ ，其中包含 :doc:`ontology` **字段**\\ （例如 ``username``\\ "
"、\\ ``fullname``\\ 、\\ ``created_at``\\ 、\\ ``is_verified``\\ ），外加一个 "
"``_extractor`` 键，用于标明匹配到的提取方案。"

#: ../../source/library-usage.rst:40 a36d28ce48c1421090c5936cd74b9771
#, python-brace-format
msgid "When nothing matches it returns ``{}``."
msgstr "当没有任何方案匹配时，它返回 ``{}``\\ 。"

#: ../../source/library-usage.rst:54 454e36a6ae98434c9596c6a382946441
msgid ""
"Because the input is just a string, you can feed ``extract`` a page from any"
" source — a live request, a saved fixture, an archive snapshot, or a proxy."
msgstr "由于输入只是一个字符串，你可以把来自任何来源的页面喂给 ``extract``——实时请求、已保存的测试固件、存档快照或代理。"

#: ../../source/library-usage.rst:57 18fbbdd1d05f4d1ebad008c6a5ee7010
msgid ""
"Set ``use_ai_fallback=True`` to opt into the LLM-based fallback when no "
"scheme matches. This is off by default and requires the optional ``[ai]`` "
"extra; see :doc:`ai-fallback` for details."
msgstr ""
"设置 ``use_ai_fallback=True`` 以在没有方案匹配时显式开启基于 LLM 的回退。该功能默认关闭，且需要可选的 ``[ai]`` "
"附加依赖；详见 :doc:`ai-fallback`。"

#: ../../source/library-usage.rst:66 fca9f3b2444645d48174079f59ce0769
msgid "parse"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/library-usage.rst:72 1645a261d3cb49f8977ae58c87fc275a
msgid ""
"``parse`` is the convenience fetcher bundled with the library. It issues a "
"GET request with browser-like default headers, follows redirects, and "
"applies any cookies you supply, then returns a ``(page_text, status_code)`` "
"tuple."
msgstr ""
"``parse`` 是库中附带的便捷抓取器。它使用类浏览器的默认请求头发起 GET 请求，跟随重定向，并应用你提供的任何 cookie，然后返回一个 "
"``(page_text, status_code)`` 元组。"

