#: ../../source/library-usage.rst:112 38444edd9acb42d0b9b6a54569f20696
msgid ""
"**Bring your own requests.** ``parse`` is a convenience, not a requirement. "
"Since :func:`extract` only needs a string, you can fetch pages however you "
"like — with your own ``requests`` session, custom headers, a retry policy, "
"or a proxy — and pass the resulting text in directly:"
msgstr ""
"**自带请求。** ``parse`` 只是便捷工具，而非必需。由于 :func:`extract` "
"只需要一个字符串，你可以按自己喜欢的方式抓取页面——使用你自己的 ``requests`` "
"会话、自定义请求头、重试策略或代理——然后直接传入得到的文本："

