"在内部使用它，但当你自己构建请求时也可以直接调用它："

#: ../../source/library-usage.rst:147 4d469492f2724a8bb2cad7348586ea29
msgid "mutate_url"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/library-usage.rst:153 2453e33f38d54032b76b3780f7b6605f
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Some schemes register ``url_mutations`` that rewrite a human-facing profile "
"URL into the API endpoint that actually carries the data — for example "
"``github.com/{username}`` into ``api.github.com/users/{username}``. "
"``mutate_url`` walks every scheme, matches the input URL against those "
"mutation rules, and returns a list of ``(mutated_url, headers)`` pairs, "
"where ``headers`` is any extra headers the mutation requires (an empty set "
"when it declares none)."
msgstr ""
"有些提取方案会注册 ``url_mutations``\\ ，把面向用户的个人资料 URL 改写为实际承载数据的 API 端点——例如把 "
"``github.com/{username}`` 改写为 ``api.github.com/users/{username}``\\ 。\\ "
"``mutate_url`` 遍历每个提取方案，将输入 URL 与这些改写规则进行匹配，并返回一个 ``(mutated_url, headers)``"
" 对的列表，其中 ``headers`` 是该改写所需的任何额外请求头（若未声明则为空集合）。"

#: ../../source/library-usage.rst:168 f49662caf6634ba19e67615e08764c57
msgid ""
"This is a **CLI-oriented helper**: it is used to expand a profile URL into "
"the richer API URLs worth fetching. :func:`extract` itself does **not** call"
" ``mutate_url`` — it only parses whatever string you give it. If you want to"
" follow a mutation, fetch the mutated URL yourself and pass its response to "
"``extract``."
msgstr ""
"这是一个\\ **面向 CLI 的辅助函数**\\ ：它用于把一个个人资料 URL 扩展为值得抓取的更丰富的 API "
"URL。:func:`extract` 本身\\ **不会**\\ 调用 "
"``mutate_url``——它只解析你给它的任何字符串。如果你想跟进某个改写，请自行抓取改写后的 URL，并把其响应传给 ``extract``\\"
" 。"

#: ../../source/library-usage.rst:175 efd987408df241d2b52210354a6256d4
msgid "Used by other tools"
msgstr "被其他工具使用"

#: ../../source/library-usage.rst:177 ae9fc3e0c9254a379aad8372bd5933c6
msgid ""
"Because the parsing surface is a single pure function, ``socid_extractor`` "
"is easy to embed. It powers `Maigret <https://github.com/soxoj/maigret>`_ "
"and a number of other OSINT tools. See :doc:`maigret-integration` for how "
"Maigret consumes the library."
msgstr ""
"由于解析接口是单个纯函数，\\ ``socid_extractor`` 很容易被嵌入。它为 `Maigret "
"<https://github.com/soxoj/maigret>`_ 以及许多其他 OSINT 工具提供支持。关于 Maigret "
"如何使用该库，请参阅 :doc:`maigret-integration`。"
